"summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"St. Peter's Church of Ireland, Drogheda","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Drogheda_-_St_Peter%27s_Church_-_20180926104707.jpg/1280px-Drogheda_-_St_Peter%27s_Church_-_20180926104707.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Drogheda_-_St_Peter%27s_Church_-_20180926104707.jpg/500px-Drogheda_-_St_Peter%27s_Church_-_20180926104707.jpg","w":1200,"h":1925,"author":"Bpmurray","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Drogheda_-_St_Peter%27s_Church_-_20180926104707.jpg"}},{"id":"drogheda_mary_mcaleese_boyne_valley_bridge","areaId":"drogheda","name":"Mary McAleese Boyne Valley Bridge","category":"landmark","tags":["views","photo","sunset"],"location":{"lat":53.71787,"lng":-6.3967},"visitMinutes":30,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"drogheda_mary_mcaleese_boyne_valley_bridge","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":20,"wikiPageviews":324,"wikidataSitelinks":4,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["marymcaleeseboynevalleybridge","drogheda"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"The Mary McAleese Boyne Valley Bridge is a cable-stayed bridge in County Meath, and County Louth, Ireland. It spans the River Boyne 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) west of Drogheda on the county boundary between County Meath and County Louth and is part of the M1 Motorway.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Mary McAleese Boyne Valley Bridge","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/Boyne_River_Bridge%2C_M1_motorway_353105.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/Boyne_River_Bridge%2C_M1_motorway_353105.jpg","w":1200,"h":1796,"author":"Peter Gerken","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boyne_River_Bridge,_M1_motorway_353105.jpg"}},{"id":"droghe